        <h2 style="font-size: 18pt; font-weight: bold; margin-bottom: 20px;">SERVICE LEARNING & COMMUNITY SERVICE</h2>
        <p style="font-size: 11pt; line-height: 1.6;">An important part of the AUC mission is to teach the next generation of physicians how to engage with their communities and work with diverse patient populations. AUC students participate in a number of outreach and volunteer programs as clinical students in the U.S. and U.K., including youth education programs, public health initiatives and outreach to underserved populations.</p>
