        <div style="font-size: 24pt;">&#9993;</div>
        <p style="font-size: 10pt;">Application documents can be sent to:</p>
        <p style="font-size: 10pt;">American University of the Caribbean School of Medicine</p>
        <p style="font-size: 10pt;">880 SW 14th Ave, Suite 202</p>
