  <div style="display: flex; gap: 40px;">
    <div style="flex: 1;">
      <h3 style="font-size: 16pt; margin-bottom: 15px;">Undergraduate Entry 6-Year Doctor of Medicine (MD) program</h3>
      <p style="font-size: 12pt; margin-bottom: 20px;">Entry into University of Central Lancashire BSc (Hons) Medical Sciences degree program</p>

      <div style="border: 1px solid #ccc; padding: 15px; margin-bottom: 20px;">
        <h4 style="font-size: 14pt; margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 10px;">FOR MORE INFORMATION ABOUT UCLAN'S ADMISSIONS AND ENTRY REQUIREMENTS VISIT:</h4>
        <p style="font-size: 12pt; margin-bottom: 10px;"><a href="#" style="color: #007bff;">{{ uclan_admission_link }}</a></p>
        <p style="font-size: 12pt;">Click on the "Find your country" link for country-specific information or contact: <span data-field="ucalan_contact_email">{{ uclan_contact_email }}</span>.</p>
      </div>

      <div style="border: 1px solid #ccc; padding: 15px;">
        <h4 style="font-size: 14pt; margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 10px;">UCLAN BSc (Hons) Medical Sciences Degree</h4>
        <p style="font-size: 12pt;">All students seeking admission to AUC School of Medicine's medical degree program via this track must fulfill all requirements to earn UCLan's BSc (Hons) in Medical Sciences degree program at 2.1 or above.</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div style="flex: 1;">
      <div style="border: 1px solid #ccc; padding: 15px;">
        <h4 style="font-size: 14pt; margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 10px;">MEDICAL ADMISSIONS TEST</h4>
        <p style="font-size: 12pt;">Non-U.S. Citizens or Permanent Residents: MCAT, UCAT, or GAMSAT.</p>
        <p style="font-size: 12pt; margin-top: 10px;">Please note that AUC will not consider MCAT and UCAT scores that are more than five years old. For the GAMSAT, only scores that are less than two years old will be considered.</p>
      </div>

      <div style="border: 1px solid #ccc; padding: 15px; margin-top: 20px;">
        <h4 style="font-size: 14pt; margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 10px;">FOR MORE INFORMATION ON AUC SCHOOL OF MEDICINE'S MEDICAL DEGREE PROGRAM, PLEASE CONTACT:</h4>
        <p style="font-size: 12pt;">Office of Admissions</p>
