  </div>

  <h1 style="font-size: 24pt; margin-bottom: 15px;">Undergraduate Entry 6-Year Doctor of Medicine (MD) program</h1>
  <p style="font-size: 12pt; margin-bottom: 30px;">Students who take the undergraduate entry pathway will complete the requirements for UCLan's BSc (Hons) in Medical Sciences, and then enter AUC School of Medicine's Doctor of Medicine degree program in Semester 2 (see page 12), with the option to study in the U.K. or Sint Maarten.</p>

