        <div style="width: 50%;">
            <h2 style="font-size: 24pt; margin-bottom: 15px;">SPORT & FITNESS</h2>
            <p style="line-height: 1.6;">UCLan has superb sports facilities at <span data-field="facility_name_1">{{ facility_name_1 }}</span> and <span data-field="facility_name_2">{{ facility_name_2 }}</span>. You can keep fit, healthy and play a variety of sports while you are here. Your sports membership allows you to access all the facilities, including the Finney Sports Centre, including the fitness suites, health and fitness classes, sports halls, squash courts. The UCLan Sports Arena provides floodlit outdoor facilities for athletics, rugby league, rugby union, football, hockey, netball, tennis and cycling. There is also a fitness suite and an indoor room for activities, theory sessions and fitness training.</p>
