            <p style="line-height: 1.6;">AUC School of Medicine students enrolled in our U.K. based program complete classes on the <span data-field="university_name">{{ university_name }}</span>.</p>
            <h3 style="font-size: 16pt; margin-top: 30px; margin-bottom: 10px;">ABOUT UCLAN</h3>
            <p style="line-height: 1.6;">The UCLan in Preston, founded in <span data-field="founding_year">{{ founding_year }}</span> as the Institution for the Diffusion of Knowledge, is now one of the U.K.'s largest universities with a staff and student community approaching <span data-field="community_size">{{ community_size }}</span> and an employment-focused course portfolio containing over <span data-field="course_count">{{ course_count }}</span> undergraduate programs and nearly <span data-field="program_count">{{ program_count }}</span> postgraduate courses. The university has an established research reputation with world-leading or internationally excellent work taking place within the areas of Business, Health, Humanities and Science. As a truly global institution, UCLan's student body includes 120 nationalities and its partnership network extends to 125 countries.</p>
